    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "not": {
              "const": "fresh_validation"
            }
          },
          "receipt": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "failure_code": {
                "const": "final_readback_unresolvable"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "failure_code"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "receipt"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_code": {
            "const": "final_readback_unresolvable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "not": {
              "const": "fresh_validation"
            }
          },
          "receipt": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "failure_code": {
                "const": "source_lane_mismatch"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "failure_code"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "receipt"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_code": {
            "const": "source_lane_mismatch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "not": {
              "const": "fresh_validation"
            }
          },
          "receipt": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "failure_code": {
                "const": "fresh_validation_failed"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "failure_code"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "receipt"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_code": {
            "const": "fresh_validation_failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "not": {
              "const": "fresh_validation"
            }
          },
          "receipt": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "failure_code": {
                "const": null
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "failure_code"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "receipt"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_code": {
            "const": null
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "phase=complete is always a definitively-resolved terminal state: applied/no_change (a genuine mutation outcome), or a not_attempted outcome that itself reached a terminal resolution (e.g. a pre-dispatch reject, or a dispatched-but-declined edit_issue_txn.py outcome such as human_judgment/failed_no_mutation -- see the `receipt.failure_code == failure_code` equality invariant above for the applicable failure_code in that case). Never `unknown` -- an unresolved outcome sits at phase=final_readback instead (see the receipt.mutation_outcome==unknown rule above).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "const": "complete"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "phase"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "mutation_outcome": {
            "enum": [
              "no_change",
              "applied",
              "not_attempted"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "PR #2202 review fix-delta (P1-3): applied + phase=complete requires fresh validation to have genuinely succeeded (a failed fresh validation moves phase to fresh_validation instead -- see the phase==fresh_validation rule below).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "mutation_outcome": {
            "const": "applied"
          },
          "phase": {
            "const": "complete"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "mutation_outcome",
          "phase"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "fresh_validation": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "success"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "status"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "PR #2202 review fix-delta (P1-3): the converse of the phase==fresh_validation rule below -- a reported fresh_validation failure that follows a definitive (applied/no_change/not_attempted) outcome must always be surfaced via phase=fresh_validation, never silently left at phase=complete. Scoped to mutation_outcome != unknown: an `unknown` outcome already sits at phase=final_readback (its own genuinely-unconfirmed-result phase, unrelated to this post-mutation consistency check) and a fresh_validation failure on top of that does not relocate it.",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "mutation_outcome": {
            "not": {
              "const": "unknown"
            }
          },
          "fresh_validation": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "failed"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "status"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "mutation_outcome",
          "fresh_validation"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "const": "fresh_validation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "PR #2202 review fix-delta (P1-3): an actually-dispatched mutation (receipt.patch_attempted) must carry a full, non-null ABA-protection provenance binding -- original_updated_at and preflight_run_identity are never null once dispatch has been attempted (mirrors the run_repair_action_apply() pre-dispatch fail-closed gate at the code level).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "receipt": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "patch_attempted": {
                "const": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "patch_attempted"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "receipt"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "provenance": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "original_updated_at": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "preflight_run_identity": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "original_updated_at",
              "preflight_run_identity"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "const": "fresh_validation"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "phase"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "failure_code": {
            "enum": [
              "source_lane_mismatch",
              "fresh_validation_failed"
            ]
          },
          "fresh_validation": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "failed"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "status"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "failure_code"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "phase": {
            "const": "complete"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "phase"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "mutation_outcome": {
            "enum": [
              "no_change",
              "applied",
              "not_attempted"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "fresh_validation": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "const": "success"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "status"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "fresh_validation"
        ]
      },
      "then": {
        "properties": {
          "fresh_validation": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "actionable_repair_remaining": {
                "const": false
              },
              "final_body_digest_match": {
                "const": true
              },
              "source_lane_preserved": {
                "const": true
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "actionable_repair_remaining",
              "final_body_digest_match",
              "source_lane_preserved"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
